All consumers below this provider are memoized. The provider's component re-renders because of unrelated state, while `user` stays the same string. What happens?

```jsx
const UserContext = createContext(null);

function App() {
  const [tick, setTick] = useState(0);
  const user = 'ann';
  return (
    <UserContext.Provider value={{ user }}>
      <Toolbar />   {/* memo, calls useContext(UserContext) */}
      <Sidebar />   {/* memo, does not read the context */}
    </UserContext.Provider>
  );
}
```

