A small store holds `{ a, b }`. Two components subscribe with `useSyncExternalStore`, each selecting one field. What re-renders when the store updates only `a`?

```jsx
const useA = () => useSyncExternalStore(store.subscribe, () => store.get().a);
const useB = () => useSyncExternalStore(store.subscribe, () => store.get().b);

function ShowA() { const a = useA(); return <p>{a}</p>; }
function ShowB() { const b = useB(); return <p>{b}</p>; }

store.set({ a: 2 }); // creates a new state object, b unchanged
```

